cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Closed-form earthquake-induced landslide hazard assessment pipeline (Makilala, North Cotabato)"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a closed-form pseudo-static Factor of Safety framework for
  shallow translational slope failure, evaluated at 5 m resolution over the
  municipality of Makilala, North Cotabato, Philippines, and validated against
  the PHIVOLCS co-seismic landslide inventory of the 2019 Cotabato-Davao del Sur
  sequence. Includes the factor-of-safety and critical seismic coefficient
  pipeline, pooled and spatially blocked validation, delta-method and Sobol
  sensitivity analyses, and the coordinate-reference-system diagnostics.
type: software
